\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 FREE FULL BUSINESS VALUATION - Example of our valuation process. \
\
Most business owners only see a true valuation when they are already sitting across the table from a buyer. By then, the leverage is gone and it is too late to change the number.\
\
A quick aside.. I represent buyers who are are buying and building value.  It is helpful for everyone involved when business owners are as prepared as possible when they start getting ready to make an exit plan.  \
\
Plus, we may have buyers that will be looking for you! \
\
The Playbook:  Three specific operational moves an owner can make 24 months before selling to dramatically move the final price. \
\
Nobody pays a premium for surprises. The businesses that clear at the top of their market band are the ones whose add-back schedules and job records are ready before a buyer is ever in the room. \
